.TH QUIPU-MERGE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-merge \- Merge a share back into ROOT, with reviewable conflict decisions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu merge\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-emit\-decisions\fR] [\fB\-\-decisions\fR] [\fB\-\-reviewer\fR] [\fB\-\-slot\-scoped\fR] [\fB\-\-propose\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIshare\-dir\fR> [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Merge a share back into ROOT, with reviewable conflict decisions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-emit\-decisions\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-decisions\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-reviewer\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-slot\-scoped\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-propose\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIshare\-dir\fR>

.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-merge\-show(1)
Show a merge\*(Aqs conflicts in the standard layout
.TP
quipu\-merge\-resolve(1)
Record one choice on one merge conflict
.TP
quipu\-merge\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
